**/windows/flutter/ephemeral/
**/linux/flutter/ephemeral/
*.iml

# Generated code from build_runner is committed for Flutter — keeps CI
# fast and lets the API contract live next to the consumer code.
# Only fully-generated OpenAPI clients live under a dedicated directory.
**/api_client/generated/

